===Etymology===
From {{etyl|yi|en}} {{m|yi|שיקסע|tr=shikse}}, which is partly derived from the {{etyl|he|en}} {{m|he|שֶׁקֶץ||abomination, impure, object of loathing|tr=shékets}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃɪksə/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|Judaism|derogatory}} A non-Jewish [[girl]], especially one who is attractive and young.

